# The active player announces attackers' combat damage first, then the defending player blockers' (CR 510.1): Bot1's face-down
# blocker, cast with Illusionary Mask, is Caelorna, Coral Tyrant (0/8). Bot2's Wildwood Patrol (4/2, trample) divides its 4
# against the face-down 2/2 - lethal is 2, so 2 tramples over to Bot1 (CR 702.19b). Only then would the blocker assign its 2:
# instead it is turned face up and assigns as Caelorna, whose 0 power assigns nothing (CR 510.1a, 614.1). The Patrol is dealt
# nothing; Caelorna, face up already, is dealt the 2.

[Bot1 Deck]
Illusionary Mask
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Mox Sapphire
Caelorna, Coral Tyrant
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
